KG42.register("source_edge_archive-7cc1aba0e6361a7b742a5629",{"id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R003::E::v141-c-R003-E001","paper":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding","rule_id":"v141-c-R003","rule_ref":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R003","record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R003-E001","source":"bidding.demand","target":"clearing.local","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R003-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07"]},"evidence_class":"S","provenance_gate":"direct_C_edge_with_constraint_and_source_excerpt","scientific_acceptance":false,"accepted_constraint_ids":["v141-c-R003-C001"],"held_constraint_ids":[],"semantic_review_status":"supported","source":"KG40-20f45ec4bdcbac06","target":"COMP-c98744ae891e04fd","source_occurrence_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R003::V::bidding.demand","target_occurrence_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-c-R003::V::clearing.local","source_unit_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-a-M01-p2p-cda::bidding.demand","target_unit_id":"25-p2p_ancillary_bidding::v141-a-M01-p2p-cda::clearing.local","omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"clearing","context_text":"Within the community's CDA Agreement Period, for a bid and ask in the order book for target time slot t.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07"]},"active":true,"source_signature":"353200d37ca7fc3c85eaa65a36e4d7bf2e33b76794a63754ec9c5490589b67d6","relation_scope":"original_occurrence_pair_only","internal_to_parent":false,"source_science":{"mechanism_id":"v141-a-M01-p2p-cda","source_definition":"Updating a partially matched demand bid is conditional on the local allocation outcome: its remaining requested quantity becomes σ'_{b,t} = σ_{b,t} - σ_{s,t}. Scope: Residual demand-bid updates in the CDA order book for time slot t during the corresponding Agreement Period. Condition: The demand bid is not fully matched and σ_{b,t} - σ_{s,t} > 0. A submitted demand bid is removed from the order book when local allocation has fully matched it. Scope: Removal of completed demand bids from the CDA order book for time slot t. Condition: The demand bid is fully matched. A customer with positive optimized net load submits a demand bid with the electricity amount to be bought equal to NL_{i,t}^*. Scope: Community customers submitting demand bids during the CDA Agreement Period corresponding to time slot t in Target Time Period T. Condition: NL_{i,t}^* > 0.","target_definition":"The submitted demand quantity supplies an input to local allocation: the matched electricity quantity is min(σ_{b,t}, σ_{s,t}). Scope: Within the community's CDA Agreement Period, for a bid and ask in the order book for target time slot t. Condition: π_{b,t} ≥ π_{s,t}. The submitted supply quantity supplies an input to local allocation: the matched electricity quantity is min(σ_{b,t}, σ_{s,t}). Scope: Within the community's CDA Agreement Period, for a bid and ask in the order book for target time slot t. Condition: π_{b,t} ≥ π_{s,t}.","constraints":[{"constraint_id":"v141-c-R003-C001","kind":"mathematical","role":"core","statement":"The submitted demand quantity supplies an input to local allocation: the matched electricity quantity is min(σ_{b,t}, σ_{s,t}). Scope: Within the community's CDA Agreement Period, for a bid and ask in the order book for target time slot t. Condition: π_{b,t} ≥ π_{s,t}.","expression":"\\pi_{b,t} \\ge \\pi_{s,t} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; \\sigma_{matched,t} = \\min(\\sigma_{b,t}, \\sigma_{s,t})","formalization_origin":"source","template_id":null,"members":["bidding.demand","clearing.local"],"variable_refs":["x_sigma_matched_t","x_sigma_b_t","x_sigma_s_t","x_pi_b_t","x_pi_s_t"],"parameter_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07","v141-b-g01-E05","v141-b-g04-E01"]}],"evidence":[{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E07","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p04-c1r3__v141-a-M01-matching","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":null,"anchor_text":"peach time slot t in the Target Time Period T, there is one order book. In seeach order book, the bi","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"condition"},"source_text":"Every time a bid/ask arrives at the exchange, it will be allocated in the corresponding order book based on the above-described principles, and then the exchange will try to match the bids and asks in the order book. If the following relationship is satisfied for a bid o_{b,t} and an ask o_{s,t}: π_{b,t} ≥ π_{s,t}, (1) then the following amount of electricity will be matched: σ_{matched,t} = min(σ_{b,t}, σ_{s,t}) (2)"},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g01-E05","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p04-c1r2__v141-a-M01-bidding","page":4,"printed_page":null,"section":null,"anchor_text":"Fig. 2. The timeline for ancillary service provision As presented in Section 2, customers trade ener","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-04.png","occurrence_role":"definition"},"source_text":"A bid, which is submitted by a buyer, is represented by o_{b,t}(b_t, π_{b,t}, σ_{b,t}, τ_{b,t}), which means that the buyer b_t would like to by the σ_{b,t} (kWh) amount of electricity at the price π_{b,t} (£/kWh), and the bid arrives at the ‘exchange’ at the time τ_{b,t}. Note that the exchange is a centralized or decentralized platform set for P2P energy trading within the community. Similarly, an ask, which is submitted by a seller is represented by o_{s,t}(s_t, π_{s,t}, σ_{s,t}, τ_{s,t})."},{"evidence_id":"v141-b-g04-E01","location":{"location_id":"src-212077b9a1-p14-c1r4__v141-a-M01-matching","page":14,"printed_page":null,"section":"Appendix A","anchor_text":"welfare of the whole community with the proposed P2P energy trading and residual balancing mechanism","equation_id":null,"figure_id":null,"table_id":null,"image_ref":"pages/page-14.png","occurrence_role":"formula"},"source_text":"CDA process for customers to reach P2P energy trading agreements\n1: while the current time is within the Agreement Period for CDA\n2: if a bid/ask associated with the time slot t arrives at the exchange\n3: put the bid/ask in the order book t (sorted by the bid/ask price);\n4: for any pair of bid o_{b,t} and ask o_{s,t} in the order book t\n5: if π_{b,t} >= π_{s,t}\n6: match the following amount of electricity: σ_{matched,t} = min(σ_{b,t}, σ_{s,t});"}],"omega":{"market_type":"LEM","network_level":null,"jurisdiction":null,"pricing_scope":null,"time_scale":null,"participant_types":[],"trading_stage":"clearing","context_text":"Within the community's CDA Agreement Period, for a bid and ask in the order book for target time slot t.","unknown_fields":["network_level","jurisdiction","pricing_scope","time_scale","participant_types"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07"]},"source_record":{"edge_id":"v141-c-R003-E001","source":"bidding.demand","target":"clearing.local","type":"links","constraint_ids":["v141-c-R003-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E07"]},"paper_scope_note":"CDA, ancillary services, and residual agreement adjustment are kept separate; arrival events, matched orders, and the next ZIP update are not variables at the same time point; reward and compensation costs are different settlement sub-items."}});
